<title>JAPAN: Nomura shares fall, match five-year low.</title>
<headline>Nomura shares fall, match five-year low.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Nomura Securities Co Ltd remained weaker on Tuesday, setting a new low for this calendar year and matching a low hit in March of 1992.</p>
<p>At 0410 GMT, shares in the scandal-hit brokerage were 30 yen lower at 1,100. Trading volume was 5.214 million shares, making it the second most heavily traded issue on the first section of the Tokyo Stock Exchange.</p>
</text>
